{"thread":{"threadID":3588,"boardID":13,"topic":"Forum Banner fixed","time":1463769427,"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","lastPostTime":1463775149,"lastPoster":"wickedy","replies":4,"views":431,"attachments":0,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":0,"cumulativeLikes":3},"tags":[{"tagID":674,"name":"KAPPA"},{"tagID":849,"name":"quality shitpost"}],"posts":[{"postID":47363,"threadID":3588,"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","subject":"Forum Banner fixed","time":1463769427,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","time":1463772894,"value":1},{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1463808428,"value":1},{"userID":1958,"username":"Guenter_VI","time":1463816800,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Da war ich nun. Alleine, wie so öfters, b-hoppend auf dem Arena-Server während ich mir den <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=HXpMSWXn0LU\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">Löwenzahn REMIX 2008 von Thomas Lizzara</a> anhörte und dachte über Gott und die Welt nach.<br>Nach einer Weile kam ich in meinen Gedanken natürlich auch zur Dream-Community.<br>Es konnte nur einen Grund dafür geben, dass ich hier mutterseelenallein herumsprang: Die meisten Mitglieder von Dream wandten sich hauptsächlich der E-Sport-Rubrik Schach zu! &quot;Heureka!&quot;, dachte ich mir, &quot;Das muss es sein!&quot;.<br>Diese Erkenntnis ist auch relativ leicht nachzuvollziehen, möge man doch mal die täglichen Logs der Shoutbox verfolgen. Doch wird dies nicht an dem Banner des Forums deutlich, weswegen ich mich direkt dazu verpflichtet fühlte, einen neuen zu kreieren:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span><br>(Seid gnädig mit mir, hatte dann doch nicht genug Motivation, um den Hintergrund gescheit hinzubekommen)</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>In diesem Sinne noch viel Spaß beim Schachspielen, ihr <a href=\"http://dream-community.de/index.php?user/2079-schachspieler/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener noreferrer\">@Schachspieler</a>  <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😏</span> </p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>MfG Pixel</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47371,"threadID":3588,"userID":null,"username":"Zeschter","subject":"","time":1463770583,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2079,"username":"KeinAdmin Brillenträger","time":1463778663,"value":1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1463784133,"value":1},{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1463808425,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich liefer dir hier noch Content.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47372,"threadID":3588,"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","subject":"","time":1463770700,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1463808424,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47375,"threadID":3588,"userID":1852,"username":"VinceG","subject":"","time":1463774601,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":4,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1791,"username":"Pixel","time":1463775348,"value":1},{"userID":2165,"username":"Makaveli1967","time":1463775499,"value":1},{"userID":2052,"username":"YellowWonderchild","time":1463778390,"value":1},{"userID":1491,"username":"Basti","time":1463808422,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span>&quot;Zescht got p(a)wned!&quot; <span class=\"archive-emoji\">😘</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":47376,"threadID":3588,"userID":1954,"username":"wickedy","subject":"","time":1463775149,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":8,"edito